# Deployment-local policy floor (fail-closed default when absent).
# The repo-root default config.yml (issue #319) is committed via the
# negation below so a fresh deployment is usable out of the box; operators
# can still drop their own config.yml over it (or point BOTTEGA_CONFIG_DIR
# elsewhere) without tracking deployment-local edits.
config.yml
